      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-4",
      "text": "The Scottish National Gallery is a five-minute walk from the hotel.",
      "source_ids": [
        "s3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-5",
      "text": "A hand-painted mural telling the story of the journeys of Scottish botanists stretches the length of the five-story staircase.",
