        "s4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-6",
      "text": "At the top of the staircase hangs a chandelier shaped like a hot air balloon, custom made by a French artisan.",
      "source_ids": [
        "s4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-7",
      "text": "Every guest room has been individually designed.",
      "source_ids": [
        "s6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-8",
      "text": "All rooms have marble bathrooms.",
      "source_ids": [
        "s10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-9",
      "text": "The dining and drinking venues are reserved exclusively for residents, and The Wallace looks directly at Edinburgh Castle.",
      "source_ids": [
        "s8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-10",
      "text": "Ghillie's Pantry is a private dining room whose walls are lined with more than one hundred whiskies.",
      "source_ids": [
        "s8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-11",
      "text": "The hotel can arrange a porter to collect luggage from Edinburgh Waverley station.",
      "source_ids": [
        "s3"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "highlights": [
    {
